{
  "pid": "public-easy-04",
  "source": "public",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "title": "Jam Pump Debouncing and Runtime Maintenance",
  "requirements": "Control a jam transfer pump on a food production line, including viscosity-signal debouncing, emergency-stop priority, runtime accumulation and a maintenance-due indication.\n\n1. Accept the viscosity condition only after VISCOSITY_OK has remained TRUE for DebounceTime. Invalidate the condition immediately when the input becomes FALSE.\n2. Allow VFD_RUN to be TRUE only when PASTE_E_STOP_NC is TRUE and the viscosity condition is valid. An emergency stop immediately disables the run output and clears any incomplete debounce timing.\n3. Accumulate PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC using the actual invocation interval CycleTime only while VFD_RUN is TRUE. Preserve the accumulated time while the pump is stopped.\n4. Set PUMP_MAINT_DUE when accumulated runtime reaches 500 hours. This indication is informational and must not affect pump operation or the safety permissive.\n5. At power-up, initialize the run output to OFF, accumulated runtime to zero and the maintenance indication to FALSE.",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "VISCOSITY_OK",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Raw signal indicating that viscosity is within the permitted range.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PASTE_E_STOP_NC",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Normally closed emergency-stop circuit; TRUE permits operation and FALSE means emergency stop.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "DebounceTime",
      "data_type": "TIME",
      "description": "Required continuous valid duration for the viscosity signal; must be positive.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "CycleTime",
      "data_type": "TIME",
      "description": "Actual elapsed interval represented by this invocation; must be positive.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "VFD_RUN",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Pump variable-frequency-drive run command.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PUMP_MAINT_DUE",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Maintenance indication when accumulated runtime reaches 500 hours.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC",
      "data_type": "LTIME",
      "description": "Accumulated enabled runtime, using a long-duration time type.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "当急停回路断开（PASTE_E_STOP_NC=FALSE）时，VFD_RUN 必须为 FALSE。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT PASTE_E_STOP_NC -> NOT VFD_RUN)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "当粘度原始信号为 FALSE 时，去抖条件立即失效，VFD_RUN 必须为 FALSE。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT VISCOSITY_OK -> NOT VFD_RUN)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "累计运行达到500小时时维护指示有效。LTIME轨迹值以纳秒记录。",
      "ltl": "G(PUMP_MAINT_DUE <-> (PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC >= 1800000000000000))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "当 VFD_RUN 为 FALSE 时，累计运行时间必须与上一拍相同（停机保持，不清零也不增加）。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT VFD_RUN -> PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC = prev(PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "运行拍按实际CycleTime累计时长，TIME输入以毫秒、LTIME输出以纳秒记录。",
      "ltl": "G(VFD_RUN -> PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC = prev(PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC) + CycleTime * 1000000)",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "text": "按实际持续时长和 DebounceTime 去抖；急停、粘度信号中断后重新计时。由不同周期的时间轨迹覆盖。",
      "ltl": "",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "timed_simulation"
    }
  ],
